{"id":"ccbc15:problem:2-11","answer":"HOT WINGS","hints":[{"number":1,"title":"我毫无头绪","html":"<p>既然如此目眩神迷，要不要把所有字母转换成盲文试试呢？注意字母的旋转方向。</p>","text":"既然如此目眩神迷，要不要把所有字母转换成盲文试试呢？注意字母的旋转方向。","assetIds":[]},{"number":2,"title":"该如何提取","html":"<p>按照原字母的方向排列整齐，每组字母可以象形得到一个更大的字母。</p>","text":"按照原字母的方向排列整齐，每组字母可以象形得到一个更大的字母。","assetIds":[]}],"additionalAnswers":[],"solution":{"status":"available","format":"text","html":"<p>图片中字母如下图所示：</p>\n<p><img alt=\"字母图片\" data-asset-id=\"asset-0e563335bce8b079fc3cb29c\" src=\"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc15/images/2/210d1b320691419094938f9f546ff5b1.webp\"/></p>\n<p>将字母写成盲文，得到图片，象形得到答案<strong>HOT WINGS</strong></p>\n<p><img alt=\"盲文图片\" data-asset-id=\"asset-09f54a25e86e74ba8d064263\" src=\"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc15/images/2/33e3bbfc0cb340f7a56ae649cac62d75.webp\"/></p>","text":"图片中字母如下图所示：\n\n将字母写成盲文，得到图片，象形得到答案\nHOT WINGS","refId":null,"assetIds":["asset-09f54a25e86e74ba8d064263","asset-0e563335bce8b079fc3cb29c"]},"extended":{"html":"","text":"","assetIds":[]},"interactive":{},"sourceMetadata":{"type":"problem","content-type":0},"failedAssets":[],"assets":[{"id":"asset-09f54a25e86e74ba8d064263","url":"https://archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc15/images/2/33e3bbfc0cb340f7a56ae649cac62d75.webp","path":"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc15/images/2/33e3bbfc0cb340f7a56ae649cac62d75.webp","mime":"image/webp","size":2232,"sha256":"8395e7718710d53fbd88f7dfbdc33d1b54e60078426e9d62c51bf0d08434c372","status":"cached","error":"","roles":["solution"],"contexts":["solution"]},{"id":"asset-0e563335bce8b079fc3cb29c","url":"https://archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc15/images/2/210d1b320691419094938f9f546ff5b1.webp","path":"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc15/images/2/210d1b320691419094938f9f546ff5b1.webp","mime":"image/webp","size":41018,"sha256":"806c74338ad40ddd88d15e4d0013e1ea8ea29a5dd7674400de145658ba9eb58e","status":"cached","error":"","roles":["solution"],"contexts":["solution"]}]}
